1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,740
Mandir bhara hua tha.

2
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:02,851
Aarti ki jyot

3
00:00:02,851 --> 00:00:04,256
lakh lakh haathon

4
00:00:04,256 --> 00:00:05,715
mein jal rahi thi.

5
00:00:05,715 --> 00:00:06,920
Magar ek kursi

6
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:07,816
khali thi.

7
00:00:07,816 --> 00:00:08,472
Us par —

8
00:00:08,472 --> 00:00:09,369
ek purana,

9
00:00:09,369 --> 00:00:10,453
geela shawl.

10
00:00:10,453 --> 00:00:11,350
Tahta hua.

11
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:12,461
Jaise kisi ne

12
00:00:12,461 --> 00:00:14,281
abhi-abhi uthaya ho.

13
00:00:14,281 --> 00:00:15,660
Log phusphusaye:

14
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:16,463
"Kaun hai?

15
00:00:16,463 --> 00:00:17,453
Koi mantri?

16
00:00:17,453 --> 00:00:18,176
Koi baba?"

17
00:00:18,176 --> 00:00:19,729
Dadaji muskuraye.

18
00:00:19,729 --> 00:00:20,933
Haath shawl pe

19
00:00:20,933 --> 00:00:21,549
rakha.

20
00:00:21,549 --> 00:00:22,727
"Mera dost hai.

21
00:00:22,727 --> 00:00:23,664
Bas yeh seat

22
00:00:23,664 --> 00:00:25,123
chahiye." Ek ladki

23
00:00:25,123 --> 00:00:26,662
baith gayi us par.

24
00:00:26,662 --> 00:00:27,866
Dadaji ne usay

25
00:00:27,866 --> 00:00:28,576
uthaya.

26
00:00:28,576 --> 00:00:29,941
Shawl saaf kiya.

27
00:00:29,941 --> 00:00:30,757
"Abhi nahi."

28
00:00:30,757 --> 00:00:31,841
Ghanti baji.

29
00:00:31,841 --> 00:00:33,019
Aarti khatam.

30
00:00:33,019 --> 00:00:34,572
Bheed chhant gayi.

31
00:00:34,572 --> 00:00:35,656
Kursi khali.

32
00:00:35,656 --> 00:00:36,740
Shawl khali.

33
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:37,918
Koi nahi aaya.

34
00:00:37,918 --> 00:00:39,123
Raat ko Dadaji

35
00:00:39,123 --> 00:00:40,126
ne wo shawl

36
00:00:40,126 --> 00:00:40,836
uthaya.

37
00:00:40,836 --> 00:00:41,545
Chooma.

38
00:00:41,545 --> 00:00:43,098
Bag mein rakh diya.

39
00:00:43,098 --> 00:00:44,235
Aur yaad aaya —

40
00:00:44,235 --> 00:00:45,882
pachpan saal pehle.

41
00:00:45,882 --> 00:00:47,153
Chhota Dadaji.

42
00:00:47,153 --> 00:00:48,170
Maa ki ungli

43
00:00:48,170 --> 00:00:48,786
pakde.

44
00:00:48,786 --> 00:00:49,870
Darwaze par.

45
00:00:49,870 --> 00:00:51,436
"Baba fauj mein hain,

46
00:00:51,436 --> 00:00:51,958
beta.

47
00:00:51,958 --> 00:00:53,337
Tuesday aayenge."

48
00:00:53,337 --> 00:00:54,983
Aaj bhi Tuesday hai.

49
00:00:54,983 --> 00:00:55,786
Woh aaye.

50
00:00:55,786 --> 00:00:56,777
Shawl mein.

51
00:00:56,777 --> 00:00:57,673
Seat mein.

52
00:00:57,673 --> 00:00:58,945
Intezaar mein.

53
00:00:58,945 --> 00:01:00,029
Har Tuesday.
